    "body": "Hold: do not merge this PR yet, although it has `merge-ready`.\n\nPR #4469 (fix for #4455) found a defect in `HolderShape::of`. On some shrink-fit holders the flange envelope covers the body, and `of` reads back a body that is smaller than the real steel. This PR writes through `HolderShape::geometry`, so an edit through `edit_user_holder` can write such a smaller outline. Holder outlines go into the collision checks.\n\nPlan: after #4469 merges, this PR takes `main`, writes through `HolderShape::component` (which refuses a shape that does not read back as itself), and moves its `shrink20()` fixture to gauge 120 mm. Then it needs a new review.\n",
